# Companion Settings — both panel-2D menus (HARD)

User-locked 2026-08-24. Checkpoint `20260825-rt18` (see gitignored `src/moat/companion/UI-UX-COMPANION.md`).

## Contract

| Context | Behavior |
|---------|----------|
| **Surface PC embed** | fit=1, fixed 400 frame, muted chrome, close X `positionRight=24` |
| **Galaxy XR 2D panel** | same chrome; `headset2dSettingsFit` only — never immersive fit |
| **Galaxy flat + sidebar open** | clamp content — no H-scroll / Notifications crush |
| **Immersive VR/MR menu** | fit=1 always; `immersiveLayout` path — do not apply iframe fit |

## Forbidden

- `transformScale` on the settings dialog (breaks uikit)
- Moving close X right of inset 24 (hangs outside providers border)
- Changing Surface fixed frame “to fix Galaxy”
- Using Galaxy iframe fit inside Enter VR/MR

